1
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:19,651
Writing, task one. Form number 11. You stayed in a hotel on holiday. The hotel wants your feedback. Answer the questions in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,222
What did you like about the hotel?

3
00:00:32,867 --> 00:00:37,697
I liked the clean room, the excellent breakfast and the very friendly staff.

4
00:00:38,733 --> 00:00:40,586
What didn't you like and why?

5
00:00:51,233 --> 00:00:54,810
I didn't like that the spa was small and there were too many people there in the evening.

6
00:00:55,867 --> 00:00:58,137
Will you come again? Why?

7
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:14,310
Yes, we'll come again because the nature here is beautiful and the food is good.

8
00:01:15,367 --> 00:01:24,925
Fill in form 11 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.

9
00:01:27,067 --> 00:01:40,988
Writing, task one. Form number 12. You want to book a table at a restaurant using an online form. Answer the questions in a full sentence, at least ten words.

10
00:01:41,833 --> 00:01:44,391
When and for how many people do you want to book?

11
00:01:55,033 --> 00:01:59,289
I'd like a booking for Saturday the twentieth at seven in the evening for six people.

12
00:02:00,333 --> 00:02:01,820
Why are you coming to us?

13
00:02:12,467 --> 00:02:17,663
We're coming because we're celebrating my wife's birthday and your restaurant has good reviews.

14
00:02:18,700 --> 00:02:20,866
Do you have any special requests?

15
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:36,566
Please give us a table by the window and one high chair, because we have a small child.

16
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:50,972
Writing, task one. Form number 13. You want to volunteer for a charity. Answer the questions in the application. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

17
00:02:51,833 --> 00:02:53,163
What can you do?

18
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:08,761
I'm a good cook, I speak Ukrainian, Russian and a little Czech, and I have a driving licence.

19
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:12,123
Why do you want to help as a volunteer?

20
00:03:22,767 --> 00:03:28,093
I want to help because people in Czechia helped me too when I came here.

21
00:03:29,133 --> 00:03:30,986
How much time can you help?

22
00:03:41,633 --> 00:03:45,340
I can help twice a week after work or one Saturday a month.

23
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:58,466
Writing, task one. Form number 14. You want to live in a student dormitory. Answer the questions in the application. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

24
00:03:59,300 --> 00:04:00,839
What and where do you study?

25
00:04:11,500 --> 00:04:16,592
I study computer science at the Czech Technical University in Prague, I'm in my first year.

26
00:04:17,633 --> 00:04:19,669
Why do you need to live in the dormitory?

27
00:04:30,333 --> 00:04:35,111
I need to live in the dormitory because I live far away and the journey to school takes two hours.

28
00:04:36,167 --> 00:04:38,019
Who do you want to share a room with?

29
00:04:48,667 --> 00:04:52,740
I'd like to live with a friend from my year, his name is Petr Novák.

30
00:04:53,800 --> 00:05:06,702
Writing, task one. Form number 15. You want to get a public transport pass. Answer the questions in the form. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

31
00:05:07,567 --> 00:05:09,419
Where and how often do you travel?

32
00:05:20,067 --> 00:05:24,140
Every day I take the bus to work and at weekends sometimes the metro to the centre.

33
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:26,870
Why do you want a pass?

34
00:05:37,533 --> 00:05:42,547
I want a pass because it's cheaper and I don't have to buy a ticket every day.

35
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:45,400
How do you want to pay for the pass?

36
00:05:56,067 --> 00:05:59,904
I want to pay online by card, ideally for the whole year at once.

37
00:06:00,967 --> 00:06:06,032
Writing, task two. E-mail number 11: An absence note for school.

38
00:06:06,867 --> 00:06:16,608
Your son will miss school. Write an e-mail to his teacher of at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

39
00:06:25,467 --> 00:06:27,267
Dear Teacher,

40
00:06:27,533 --> 00:06:30,326
I am writing to excuse my son Matvij from class 3A.

41
00:06:30,567 --> 00:06:33,360
Next week he won't be at school from Monday to Wednesday.

42
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:36,158
We are going to Ukraine for his grandfather's funeral.

43
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:39,924
He will do his homework at home, please send it to us by e-mail.

44
00:06:40,167 --> 00:06:42,333
He will be back at school on Thursday.

45
00:06:42,567 --> 00:06:44,132
Thank you for your understanding.

46
00:06:44,367 --> 00:06:51,104
This e-mail has 50 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and at the end.

47
00:06:52,167 --> 00:06:57,232
Writing, task two. E-mail number 12: A bike for sale.

48
00:06:58,067 --> 00:07:09,532
You want to sell your old bike. Write an e-mail to a friend who is looking for a bike, at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

49
00:07:18,367 --> 00:07:19,671
Hi Jirka,

50
00:07:19,933 --> 00:07:21,786
I heard you're looking for a bike.

51
00:07:22,033 --> 00:07:26,106
I'm selling my mountain bike, it's blue and has 21 gears.

52
00:07:26,367 --> 00:07:29,238
I've had it for three years, but I didn't ride it much.

53
00:07:29,500 --> 00:07:32,920
I'm selling it because I bought an e-bike.

54
00:07:33,167 --> 00:07:35,097
I want 4,000 crowns for it.

55
00:07:35,333 --> 00:07:37,969
You can come and have a look at it on Saturday morning.

56
00:07:38,233 --> 00:07:44,971
This e-mail has 50 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and at the end.

57
00:07:46,033 --> 00:07:52,353
Writing, task two. E-mail number 13: The heating doesn't work.

58
00:07:53,200 --> 00:08:02,941
The heating in your flat doesn't work. Write an e-mail to the landlord, at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

59
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:13,522
Dear Mr Veselý,

60
00:08:13,767 --> 00:08:15,619
the heating in our flat doesn't work.

61
00:08:15,867 --> 00:08:18,006
The radiators are completely cold.

62
00:08:18,267 --> 00:08:20,903
It's been like this since Monday, three days.

63
00:08:21,167 --> 00:08:24,221
It's only fifteen degrees in the flat and my son has a cold.

64
00:08:24,467 --> 00:08:26,789
Please send a repairman as soon as possible.

65
00:08:27,033 --> 00:08:29,669
We're at home every day from four in the afternoon.

66
00:08:29,933 --> 00:08:30,689
Thank you.

67
00:08:30,933 --> 00:08:38,402
This e-mail has 48 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and at the end.

68
00:08:39,467 --> 00:08:45,029
Writing, task two. E-mail number 14: Invitation to a barbecue.

69
00:08:45,867 --> 00:08:55,948
You want to invite your neighbours to a barbecue. Write an e-mail to them, at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

70
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:06,104
Dear neighbours,

71
00:09:06,367 --> 00:09:11,798
we'd like to invite you to a barbecue because we've just moved here and want to get to know you.

72
00:09:12,033 --> 00:09:15,375
It will be on Saturday, the 6th of June, from five in the afternoon.

73
00:09:15,633 --> 00:09:17,799
We'll grill in the garden behind the house.

74
00:09:18,033 --> 00:09:21,662
We'll have meat and drinks, please bring a salad or some bread.

75
00:09:21,900 --> 00:09:23,935
Please reply by Wednesday.

76
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:31,068
This e-mail has 54 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and at the end.

77
00:09:32,133 --> 00:09:37,617
Writing, task two. E-mail number 15: A complaint.

78
00:09:38,467 --> 00:09:49,384
You were at a restaurant and weren't happy. Write an e-mail to the owner, at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

79
00:09:58,233 --> 00:09:59,433
Good afternoon,

80
00:09:59,667 --> 00:10:02,486
on Saturday evening I was at your restaurant with my family.

81
00:10:02,733 --> 00:10:05,239
We ordered pasta and two pizzas.

82
00:10:05,500 --> 00:10:08,241
The food was cold and the pizza was burnt.

83
00:10:08,500 --> 00:10:11,554
We waited an hour for the food and the waiter was rude.

84
00:10:11,800 --> 00:10:15,977
I would like you to refund part of the money or give us a discount next time.

85
00:10:16,233 --> 00:10:23,415
This e-mail has 52 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

86
00:10:24,467 --> 00:10:32,824
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
